Tasks. We consider 11 regular languages spanning 2–86 states: the 6 Tomita grammars (Tomita,
1982), Parity, and 4 bounded Dyck languages. Tomita grammars comprise small DFAs (2–5 states)
and is commonly used as a benchmark for automata extraction (Wang et al., 2018; Weiss et al., 2018;
